# GitHub decides the language of a repo by how many bytes each language takes.
# The web files inside assets/ are bigger than the Kotlin shell, so GitHub was
# showing this app as "HTML". These lines tell GitHub to skip the web files
# when it counts, so the app shows as Kotlin, which is what it really is.
#
# This changes nothing in the build. It only affects the label on GitHub.

app/src/main/assets/** linguist-vendored
